message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Nanosim: Microcanonical Monte Carlo Simulation of 1D Ising Lattice"
abstract: "A high-performance Python implementation of Creutz's microcanonical demon algorithm for studying thermodynamic irreversibility in 1D Ising systems. Features both reversible and irreversible dynamics with JIT compilation achieving ~1400x speedup."
